      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "Equation 6.12 applies equally well to AA homozygotes as to aa homozygotes. Therefore, letting P represent the frequency of homozygous AA genotypes, we can write $$ P_{s e p a r a t e}-P_{f u s e d}=\\sigma_{p}^{2} $$",
